    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d927">

                <pb facs="0948" n="860" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg860"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Finch to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Montevideo,
                                Uruguay</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-12-26"><hi rendition="#italic">December 26,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 799.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Peace in Paraguay. The revolutionists have
                    triumphed. The agreement entered into at Formosa, Argentina, has finally been
                    signed by the revolutionary leaders and the Government’s representatives,
                    General Ferreyra, the military leader of the revolution, being the last one to
                    sign, and on account of his unexplained hesitation it was feared, for a few
                    days, that the agreement would fail.</p>
                <p>I inclose translation of the agreement or treaty of peace. * * *</p>
                <p>Respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William R. Finch.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d927-a1.xml" xpointer="d927-a1"/>
            </div>
